      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   Nos 82 to 88 (even) TL 0507 1/167 II                       GV 2. C18 or earlier.  Colour washed cement rendering, old tiled roof.  2 storeys. 4 flush 2 light sash windows to ground floor, 5 single light to lst floor.  Modern. cut bracketted doorhoods.  Included for group value. Nos 48 to 88 (even); Nos 94 to 100 (even) and Barn in garden of Nos 62 and 64 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0548007959"
    }
